#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:45
#: cc49babdfd7f44e3897f9b654875d780
msgid ""
"Serial protocols shown are defaults, but can be adjusted to personal "
"preferences."
msgstr "所示串口协议为默认值，可根据个人偏好调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:48
#: 5d898cd7b410451a87a9b7d27bb9e98a
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:49
#: f92e82af681045fdbb3b549c888d019b
msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on the UART6 RX6 input and can be used "
"for all ArduPilot supported unidirectional receiver protocols. The SBus "
"input on the HD VTX connector is tied to RX6 so disconnect its wire if using"
" RX6 for a different RC receiver."
msgstr ""
"默认 RC 输入配置在 UART6 RX6 输入上，兼容所有 ArduPilot 支持的单向接收机协议。高清图传接头上的 SBus 输入连接至 "
"RX6，如果使用 RX6 连接其他 RC 接收机，请断开该连线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:51
#: 4dbd074ee9064b09be13b11553c13835
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:52
#: 15f456f508244a1f90ae6982aae211c5
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX6 pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接至 RX6 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:53
#: 86e4deb7b58f4a928e8a0022a0139ae2
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX6 and RX6 via a bi-directional inverter. See "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr "FPort 需通过双向电平转换器连接至 TX6 和 RX6。请参阅 :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:54
#: 89e88c2f03b14ebb9b9485ef86ff7215
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX6 connection, in addition to RX6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除 RX6 外还需连接 TX6，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:55
#: 7679108787f44b30ac4035c25f2417d8
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX6 and automatically provides telemetry. Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` to “4”."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接 TX6 并自动提供数传。请将 :ref:`SERIAL5_OPTIONS<SERIAL5_OPTIONS>` 设为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:58
#: cd7b3fb560d64d07b6581d31a7e54b79
msgid "OSD"
msgstr "OSD"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:59
#: 10fe328c15124e278124538acecb4c1a
msgid ""
"MicoAir743-AIO supports using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). External OSD support such as DJI or DisplayPort can be used "
"simultaneously and is pre-configured on SERIAL2 but can be supported on any "
"spare UART. See :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2` for more info."
msgstr ""
"MicoAir743-AIO 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的内置 OSD。外置 OSD 如 DJI 或 DisplayPort"
" 可同时启用，默认预配置于 SERIAL2，也可在任何空闲 UART 上使用。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-msp-osd-"
"overview-4.2`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:62
#: f86527e71b0b450086ce73e2ccdeb882
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr "图传支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:64
#: 2e34c7296e6c4fe49bda3e3fbb97f3e6
msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a DJI Air Unit / HD VTX connection. Protocol"
" defaults to DisplayPort. Pin 1 of the connector is 12v so be careful not to"
" connect this to a peripheral requiring 5v."
msgstr ""
"SH1.0-6P 接头支持 DJI Air Unit/高清图传连接。协议默认为 DisplayPort。接头的第 1 针为 12V，请勿将其连接到需要 "
"5V 的外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:67
#: 85e3981e30e5425286a9a6402db60933
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:68
#: 650d09f5f2064621bdf2487c13c41c3a
msgid "The MicoAir743-AIO supports up to 9 PWM outputs."
msgstr "MicoAir743-AIO 最多支持 9 路 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:70
#: 991d7176e5e24e7aac7a069e89709511
msgid ""
"All the channels support DShot. Channels 1-8 support bi-directional DShot. "
"PWM outputs are grouped and every group must use the same output protocol:"
msgstr "所有通道均支持 DShot，通道 1-8 支持双向 DShot。PWM 输出按组划分，每组必须使用相同的输出协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:72
#: f28d5dc2de22412f95126d29992db806
msgid "1, 2, 3, 4 are Group 1;"
msgstr "1、2、3、4 属于第 1 组；"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:73
#: 92ef257b88914e49bf4dbb1a488e9e82
msgid "5, 6 are Group 2;"
msgstr "5、6 属于第 2 组；"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:74
#: b6f2bb604dd24949979c4f6f2f5f1fc5
msgid "7, 8, 9 are Group 3;"
msgstr "7、8、9 属于第 3 组；"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:76
#: 21008c241ac54ae9b35b13f4a2a907a1
msgid ""
"PWM1-4 are internally tied to the 4-in-1 ESC. PWM 9 is labeled as LED output"
" on the board."
msgstr "PWM1-4 在内部连接至 4 合 1 ESC。PWM 9 在板上标注为 LED 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:79
#: d3aef67f432a4255a65d1b288da6fa17
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:80
#: a4f66bdcb8cf48528a5c386530abc040
msgid ""
"The board has internal voltage and current sensors for the battery. The "
"voltage input is compatible with 3~6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该飞控板内置电池电压和电流传感器，兼容 3-6S 锂电池输入电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:83
#: a646f5388b694ced8c6d5363a81e87a9
msgid "The default battery parameters are:"
msgstr "默认电池参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:85
#: 61b44bb50d7e42799c00f4e10cefd624
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:86
#: 93a2c701cdf54620a9974c743b5c2c1f
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:87
#: 4466c10cf9654b8db0091de8a85b24a3
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:88
#: 2439e2f3c8434b32915fb9c0ba70ace7
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 21.2"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 21.2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:89
#: 0b09be4c51b841719dda5c36cdde64d7
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 14.14"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 14.14"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:92
#: a603bf9db66849a898acccd29b8a32f1
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:93
#: 5f34110175bd42d6a9c80dabe81ec124
msgid ""
"The MicoAir743-AIO does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL connector."
msgstr "MicoAir743-AIO 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 接头使用 I2C 连接外置罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:97
#: 8585f1c2da06468481cd6377e22d14f0
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:98
#: b9fcf77831934f868072b928366bd87e
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here <firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in "
"sub-folders labeled “MicoAir743-AIO”."
msgstr "该飞控板的固件可在 `此处 <firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的「MicoAir743-AIO」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:101
#: 3cad2db22f864e8fb49c50a0b2689ac5
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:103
#: 3d326dcac0da4518a21864954ca34dc4
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"\\*xxxxx_with_bl.hex\""
" firmware, using your favorite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"首次固件加载可在按住引导程序按钮插入 USB 时通过 DFU 完成。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU "
"烧写工具加载「\\*xxxxx_with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-MicoAir743-AIO.rst:105
#: a55762259937466a9faa76946adcb413
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"\"\\*.apj\" firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任何 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用「\\*.apj」固件文件。"
